OL,3,ASix dead, 130 missing after Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry capsizes in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have died and 107 have been
OL,7,Frescued from a capsized Indonesian
OL,8,Fpassenger ferry in the Java Sea,
OL,9,Fauthorities have said.
OL,11,FA search and rescue operation was
OL,12,Flaunched after contact was lost with
OL,13,Fthe Virgo Transport 8 ship, which was
OL,14,Fcarrying 243 people, as it encountered
OL,15,Fbad weather, according to the search
OL,16,Fand rescue agency.
OL,18,FThe search for the remaining passengers
OL,19,Fis ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
