OL,3,ASix dead, 130 missing after Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry capsizes in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry was travelling from Surabaya
OL,7,Fto the South Kalimantan city of
OL,8,FBanjarmasin and was last reported to be
OL,9,Fabout 150km (93 miles) south of
OL,10,FBanjarmasin around 02:00 on Sunday
OL,11,F(18:00 GMT on Saturday).
